WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.197 --> 00:00:14.346
The baby Rocket Girl giggled and drooled.

2
00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:18.529
Vanda hurried outside.

3
00:00:18.549 --> 00:00:22.172
"Rocket Girl can't stop me now.

4
00:00:23.113 --> 00:00:24.934
I'll go out and steal more money!"

5
00:00:27.937 --> 00:00:29.938
Baby Roxy shivered in the cold mist.

6
00:00:30.899 --> 00:00:31.880
She began to cry.

7
00:00:37.384 --> 00:00:39.225
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

8
00:00:40.046 --> 00:00:41.887
Her heat vision warmed up the mist.

9
00:00:43.408 --> 00:00:44.589
Suddenly Roxy grew.

10
00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.670
She was an eight-year-old again!

11
00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.472
"Wow!" Roxy said.

12
00:00:49.492 --> 00:00:53.175
"Vanda's treatment only works if it's cold!"

13
00:00:54.215 --> 00:00:55.276
She looked around the spa.

14
00:00:55.296 --> 00:01:02.341
"I have to find Vanda and stop her from stealing."

15
00:01:04.682 --> 00:01:06.604
She used her heat vision to warm up the tank.

16
00:01:11.089 --> 00:01:12.669
Then she picked it up and flew off.

17
00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:17.871
As she flew, she sprayed the warm mist over the city.

18
00:01:20.051 --> 00:01:23.032
Down on the streets, babies slowly turned back into adults.

19
00:01:24.312 --> 00:01:26.993
Roxy was flying over her own neighborhood when she heard Mara.

20
00:01:27.013 --> 00:01:30.234
"Rocket Girl!"

21
00:01:30.634 --> 00:01:31.294
Mara cried.

22
00:01:31.314 --> 00:01:33.015
"I need help!"

23
00:01:34.315 --> 00:01:37.116
Roxy landed and saw Mara with a toddler and a baby.

24
00:01:38.336 --> 00:01:40.958
"I'm so glad I saw you," Mara said.

25
00:01:40.978 --> 00:01:44.079
"I'm supposed to be a mother's helper for Mrs.

26
00:01:44.139 --> 00:01:46.561
Garson. But I can't find her.

27
00:01:46.581 --> 00:01:51.023
Her two-year-old is here, and so is this mystery baby!

28
00:01:51.784 --> 00:01:52.704
What should I do?"

29
00:01:57.287 --> 00:01:59.248
Roxy sprayed the baby with the warm mist.

30
00:02:00.189 --> 00:02:01.790
The baby turned into a grown woman.

31
00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:04.651
"Mrs. Garson!"

32
00:02:05.131 --> 00:02:05.812
Mara cried.

33
00:02:06.772 --> 00:02:08.312
Mrs. Garson looked confused.

34
00:02:08.332 --> 00:02:10.393
"What happened to me?"

35
00:02:10.413 --> 00:02:12.334
"Don't worry, Mrs.

36
00:02:12.394 --> 00:02:13.714
Garson," Roxy said.

37
00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:15.314
"You're fine now!"

38
00:02:16.795 --> 00:02:17.755
Roxy took off again.

39
00:02:18.855 --> 00:02:20.696
She turned more babies back into adults.

40
00:02:22.236 --> 00:02:25.017
Then her super ears heard an alarm going off across town.

41
00:02:26.017 --> 00:02:27.357
Roxy flew toward the sound.

42
00:02:29.478 --> 00:02:31.839
Vanda was running out of a bank with bags of money.

43
00:02:34.199 --> 00:02:36.540
Roxy used her super breath to cool down the tank.

44
00:02:37.684 --> 00:02:38.745
She swooped at Vanda.

45
00:02:40.845 --> 00:02:42.126
She sprayed cold mist.

46
00:02:43.446 --> 00:02:44.547
Vanda grew small.

47
00:02:44.567 --> 00:02:47.188
"Goo-goo, ga-ga!"

48
00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:52.330
Roxy scooped up the baby Vanda and flew off.

49
00:02:54.331 --> 00:02:55.872
Terrell and Jack were playing soccer.

50
00:02:58.913 --> 00:03:00.434
"I see Rocket Girl!"

51
00:03:00.734 --> 00:03:01.414
Terrell said.

52
00:03:02.995 --> 00:03:03.735
Jack gasped.

53
00:03:04.495 --> 00:03:05.856
"She's carrying a baby!"

54
00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:10.741
Back at Metro City Plumbing Supply, Roxy heated up the tank again.

55
00:03:11.921 --> 00:03:13.902
Then she sprayed the Detective Smith and Mr.

56
00:03:13.922 --> 00:03:14.622
Copper babies.

57
00:03:15.682 --> 00:03:16.943
They turned back into adults.

58
00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:19.483
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

59
00:03:19.803 --> 00:03:20.764
Detective Smith said.

60
00:03:20.784 --> 00:03:23.684
"Being a baby was terrible!"

61
00:03:24.485 --> 00:03:26.105
Roxy handed him the baby Vanda.

62
00:03:26.125 --> 00:03:30.026
"You can take this baby to jail, Detective!"

63
00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:36.828
That evening Roxy and her friends were playing a board game.

64
00:03:37.876 --> 00:03:39.076
"How was your job, Mara?"

65
00:03:39.417 --> 00:03:40.097
Roxy asked.

66
00:03:40.117 --> 00:03:42.818
"It was great," Mara said.

67
00:03:42.838 --> 00:03:45.118
"I saw Rocket Girl!"

68
00:03:45.138 --> 00:03:48.419
"Wow!" Roxy pretended to be surprised.

69
00:03:48.439 --> 00:03:51.160
"I saw her too," Terrell said.

70
00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:53.141
"She was babysitting."

71
00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:56.522
"Really?" Roxy shrugged.

72
00:03:56.542 --> 00:03:57.822
"That's odd."

73
00:03:59.022 --> 00:04:00.723
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

74
00:04:01.623 --> 00:04:04.304
"Yes, it was very odd."
